{"symbol":"AFG.OL","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-16T18:24:50Z","info":{"address1":"Standardveien 1","city":"Oslo","zip":"0581","country":"Norway","phone":"47 22 89 11 00","website":"https://afgruppen.com","industry":"Engineering & Construction","industryKey":"engineering-construction","industryDisp":"Engineering & Construction","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"AF Gruppen ASA, a contracting and industrial company, provides civil engineering, construction, energy and environment, and property and offshore services in Norway and Sweden. The company provides civil engineering services, including construction of various projects, such as roads, railways, airports, foundation work, building, fitting and securing tunnels, bridges, port facilities, tunnels, renovation and construction of concrete structures, power and energy plants, and onshore facilities for oil and gas; and concrete technology, groundwork and earthmoving, geomatics and surveying, and project support services. It also operates as a turnkey contractor for the development and planning to buildings comprising residential, commercial, public buildings, and rehabilitation and rebuilding, as well as offers extension work services. In addition, the company provides energy solutions, which includes energy performing contracting, technical turnkey contract, local power supply, and technical services and maintenance; and energy solutions for existing and new buildings. Further, the company manages construction and decommissioning projects, including removal and recycling of offshore installations; offers turnkey services in the areas of cooling and ventilation for onshore and offshore installations, rigs, and ships, as well as offshore wind services; and operates as a contractor for demolition and environmental clean-up services for buildings and structures, such as blasting, dredging, handling of contaminated bulk material, and removal of shipwrecks. Additionally, it provides office spaces on rental basis, and sale of homes. AF Gruppen ASA was founded in 1985 and is headquartered in Oslo, Norway.","fullTimeEmployees":5525,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Amund  Tøftum","age":47,"title":"Chief Executive Officer","yearBorn":1978,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":9896000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Anny  Øen","age":51,"title":"Executive VP of Finance & CFO","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":5467000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Bård  Frydenlund","age":57,"title":"Executive Vice President of Sweden and Betonmast","yearBorn":1968,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":5184000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Tormod  Solberg","age":54,"title":"Executive Vice President of Construction","yearBorn":1971,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":4998000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Eirik  Wraal","age":46,"title":"Executive Vice President Energy, Environment & Parts of Construction","yearBorn":1979,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":5017000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Geir  Flata","age":47,"title":"Executive Vice President of Civil Engineering & Property","yearBorn":1978,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":5708000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Lars Myhre Hjelmeset","age":46,"title":"Executive Vice President of Offshore","yearBorn":1979,"fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":4673000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Knut  Ekern","age":52,"title":"Communication Director","yearBorn":1973,"fiscalYear":2024,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Kelly Ann Fusner C.P.C.U.","title":"Chief Underwriting Officer","fiscalYear":2024,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":4,"boardRisk":7,"compensationRisk":9,"shareHolderRightsRisk":4,"overallRisk":8,"governanceEpochDate":179349120